# Native build artifacts produced by `tree-sitter generate` / node-gyp.
# The generated `src/parser.c`, `src/grammar.json`, `src/node-types.json` and
# `src/tree_sitter/` headers are intentionally NOT ignored: a publishable
# tree-sitter grammar ships its generated parser so consumers need not run the
# tree-sitter CLI themselves.
build/
prebuilds/
*.wasm
*.obj
*.o
*.dylib
*.so
*.dll

# Generated by `pnpm parity`.
parity-report.md
parity-fixtures.html

# Generated by `pnpm parity:markdown`: the report, plus the corpus download
# cache and the cloned+built upstream tree-sitter-markdown@9a23c1a used for the
# before/after comparison. All re-creatable on the next run.
parity-markdown-report.md
.parity-cache/

# Editor/log noise.
*.log
